      },
      {
        "native_id": "0x3nkjvnntw6",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "We have observed recovery since 04:50 UTC but have been advised by Interac that ongoing maintenance will occur until 15:00 UTC. During this period, there may be intermittent errors and increased response times with Interac payments. We are monitoring closely and will share updates as soon as they are available.",
